SpiritedWebTerm
===============

This project includes a browser frontend inspired by / derived from Ghostty's
WebAssembly terminal examples and depends at runtime on libghostty-vt
(ghostty-vt.wasm) from the Ghostty project:

  https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty

